<title>POLAND: PROCHEM NOV NET TURNS TO PROFIT.</title>
<headline>PROCHEM NOV NET TURNS TO PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.25 vs   0.29 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.44 vs   0.38 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.11 vs   0.86 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    6.28 vs   3.46</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.02 vs   2.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.03 vs   3.84</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.73 vs   0.10 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   39.27 vs  48.28</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish engineering company is</p>
<p>Prochem SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
